WEBVTT

00:14.514 --> 00:15.348
His heart…

00:15.432 --> 00:18.852
Why isn't it beating?

00:18.935 --> 00:21.563
My dad's not dead.

00:22.439 --> 00:25.108
If I can get his Stand back,
he'll surely come back to life.

00:25.692 --> 00:29.112
I'll tell you one thing.
That power that awakened within you…

00:29.612 --> 00:32.157
It's called a Stand ability.

00:32.240 --> 00:35.118
I have to go see her. Jolyne…

00:35.618 --> 00:37.370
Jolyne Cujoh.

00:41.958 --> 00:43.293
PUNISHMENT WARD

00:43.376 --> 00:44.252
I see.

00:44.753 --> 00:47.297
So Ermes has learned about Stand abilities

00:47.380 --> 00:48.798
and about the discs too.

00:50.258 --> 00:55.180
When Ermes inserted
McQueen's memory disc back into him,

00:56.264 --> 00:58.099
he came back to life.

00:58.183 --> 00:59.684
He was resuscitated.

01:01.436 --> 01:05.565
We may be able to bring your father back
if we have his discs!

01:07.233 --> 01:10.278
And what did you do
with this janitor's discs?

01:10.361 --> 01:12.155
I'm keeping them safe.

01:12.238 --> 01:13.239
I have both discs.

01:15.075 --> 01:16.826
She said the guards would find it

01:16.910 --> 01:19.329
during body checks
if she brought them to her cell.

01:19.913 --> 01:21.748
I'll hold on to his Stand ability,

01:22.248 --> 01:25.043
but I'll insert
his memory disc back later.

01:28.088 --> 01:30.381
McQueen's memory disc.

01:30.882 --> 01:34.969
This disc contains memories
related to Pale Snake.

01:36.179 --> 01:37.263
And maybe

01:37.347 --> 01:39.724
memories of Dad's discs too.

01:55.448 --> 01:56.282
It's coming!

01:59.077 --> 02:01.913
Hurry, shut the door!

02:02.497 --> 02:06.459
I was only trying to change
the tractor's tire!

02:06.960 --> 02:08.586
I barely touched it!

02:10.380 --> 02:11.381
Hurry!

02:13.424 --> 02:15.093
Hurry, get out of there!

02:16.469 --> 02:17.971
We need to close this door!

02:18.054 --> 02:19.222
Come on, help me!

02:19.305 --> 02:20.348
Okay!

02:23.810 --> 02:25.562
It's heavy!

02:25.645 --> 02:28.189
Pull harder! It's almost closed.

02:28.273 --> 02:29.566
Now, pull!

02:31.276 --> 02:34.654
What the hell are you doing?
I said pull harder!

02:37.574 --> 02:39.659
Those aren't my arms…

02:39.742 --> 02:40.660
Bro!

02:41.286 --> 02:42.287
I know.

02:43.496 --> 02:46.374
I was the one…

02:47.625 --> 02:49.919
who didn't pull hard enough--

04:38.861 --> 04:40.780
EPISODE 7: THERE'S SIX OF US!

04:40.863 --> 04:42.865
Fine weather, as always.

04:42.949 --> 04:46.953
Tell me, Charlotte,
what is this commotion for?

04:47.453 --> 04:49.914
Why did we call this assembly?

04:49.998 --> 04:51.791
This afternoon,

04:51.874 --> 04:54.752
two inmates went missing
on the farm grounds.

04:54.836 --> 04:56.546
Is that so?

04:57.046 --> 04:58.923
That's not good.

04:59.507 --> 05:02.468
The prisoners could not have
escaped from the farm grounds.

05:02.552 --> 05:05.054
They must have drowned
in the surrounding wetlands

05:05.138 --> 05:06.973
or gotten bitten by venomous snakes.

05:07.056 --> 05:10.059
I think we need
to assemble a search party.

05:10.143 --> 05:14.230
Why don't you talk about the possibility
of them being eaten by a crocodile?

05:15.398 --> 05:16.649
Maybe a female crocodile.

05:16.733 --> 05:19.235
Who was that? What did you say?!

05:19.819 --> 05:24.240
I did not eat them! I am innocent!

05:26.659 --> 05:27.702
Anyways.

05:28.328 --> 05:32.415
I have called you here
to form a volunteer search party.

05:32.999 --> 05:37.378
You will not be compensated,
nor will your sentence get shortened.

05:37.462 --> 05:40.506
I'd like to ask for your compassion.

05:41.090 --> 05:42.633
Are there any volunteers?

05:56.898 --> 05:58.566
Come on, Jolyne.

05:58.649 --> 06:00.735
You just got out of the Punishment Ward.

06:00.818 --> 06:03.404
Why would choose to tire yourself more?

06:03.488 --> 06:05.990
Because you won't be there.

06:06.074 --> 06:06.908
What?

06:06.991 --> 06:08.618
Very well.

06:08.701 --> 06:10.161
A party of five is plenty.

06:10.244 --> 06:12.163
Guard, bring the usual please.

06:13.081 --> 06:15.291
Inmates going to the farm

06:15.375 --> 06:19.212
must wear this
on their wrists to prevent escape.

06:20.463 --> 06:21.672
"Like a Virgin."

06:21.756 --> 06:24.342
Also known as "invisible wall."

06:24.967 --> 06:28.930
In trying to take the bracelet cuffs off
you give it impact,

06:29.013 --> 06:30.556
or if it breaks,

06:30.640 --> 06:32.892
it will explode immediately.

06:32.975 --> 06:35.978
Furthermore, if you stray
farther than 50 meters from me,

06:36.062 --> 06:38.606
it will explode.

06:39.232 --> 06:42.693
It would be difficult
to wipe your asses without your arms.

06:57.875 --> 06:59.794
Let's go, all five of you!

07:04.382 --> 07:06.050
Fifty meters?

07:09.011 --> 07:11.055
We're supposed to run?

07:11.139 --> 07:13.558
Wait up! Hey!

07:18.855 --> 07:22.483
All right, we'll split up here
and start the search.

07:22.984 --> 07:25.278
The grassy area there is a marsh.

07:25.361 --> 07:28.322
There could be crocodiles, so watch out!

07:37.665 --> 07:39.250
They wouldn't be here.

07:40.418 --> 07:43.588
Why did you volunteer, Jolyne?

07:43.671 --> 07:46.799
Well, it works well for me.

07:46.883 --> 07:50.052
There are plenty of things
I have to ask you.

07:51.053 --> 07:53.764
About the disc

07:53.848 --> 07:56.517
and about the guy named Pale Snake.

07:57.018 --> 07:59.020
Did you try it out?

07:59.103 --> 08:02.482
Did you read McQueen's disc?

08:02.565 --> 08:05.026
Yes, I gave it a try,

08:05.109 --> 08:07.695
but it made me feel terrible.

08:07.778 --> 08:11.282
It felt as if a stench
was entering my brain.

08:11.365 --> 08:13.910
-Then you haven't noticed.
-What?

08:13.993 --> 08:16.704
The image within the disc

08:17.205 --> 08:20.500
contained clues on Pale Snake's aim.

08:25.922 --> 08:28.216
McQueen.

08:28.299 --> 08:31.677
This disc will suit you.

08:32.261 --> 08:34.180
It's yours now.

08:34.263 --> 08:36.849
This is now your Stand ability.

08:41.562 --> 08:44.690
They're stored in one of
the farm tractor tires?

08:46.234 --> 08:49.904
You saw a bunch of them there?

08:49.987 --> 08:51.781
His aim is to collect the discs.

08:52.281 --> 08:57.453
He was collecting Stand abilities and
memories he stole from other Stand users.

08:59.038 --> 09:01.791
There are dozens of discs.

09:01.874 --> 09:06.796
He has to keep them hidden from
the prison guards and other prisoners.

09:07.547 --> 09:09.632
That's why he has them hidden in a tire.

09:10.383 --> 09:13.803
My father's Star Platinum and memory discs

09:13.886 --> 09:15.721
might be stashed there.

09:15.805 --> 09:17.640
What? Father?

09:17.723 --> 09:20.685
So you're searching
for your father's discs?

09:22.979 --> 09:27.066
Sorry, but I don't know
anything more about him.

09:30.278 --> 09:32.321
I'll look for the tractor from the disc.

09:38.744 --> 09:40.538
A tractor?

09:42.164 --> 09:44.667
There's a good number of them here.

09:48.754 --> 09:51.007
-That shed.
-Right.

09:53.759 --> 09:58.306
Hey! You two seem
to be enjoying yourselves.

09:58.389 --> 10:00.933
You think this is a picnic or something?

10:01.017 --> 10:02.852
You're not searching at all!

10:02.935 --> 10:06.314
No, we were discussing
that shed over there.

10:06.397 --> 10:07.857
We'll go search there.

10:07.940 --> 10:10.318
You made us run after you on purpose.

10:10.401 --> 10:12.320
Who's the one having fun here?

10:12.403 --> 10:15.281
Hold it! Did you mutter something?

10:15.364 --> 10:17.366
Oh, it's nothing.

10:17.450 --> 10:21.787
I swore to run around
like a dog and search.

10:21.871 --> 10:24.332
I don't like her.

10:26.125 --> 10:28.127
Crocodile feces.

10:30.046 --> 10:32.965
I said hold it! You disrespectful bitch!

10:33.049 --> 10:35.509
I'm the guard here!

10:38.929 --> 10:42.808
Oops. That was an accident.

10:42.892 --> 10:46.395
The stick accidentally hit it, right?

10:47.938 --> 10:49.523
What is this sound?

10:49.607 --> 10:51.192
Why is my bracelet beeping?

10:51.275 --> 10:54.487
That wasn't on purpose.

10:54.570 --> 10:56.364
You ran into me.

10:56.447 --> 10:59.367
It won't explode, will it?

10:59.450 --> 11:01.118
That was a bad joke.

11:01.202 --> 11:02.536
Do something about it!

11:02.620 --> 11:05.539
Hey now, stay away from me.

11:05.623 --> 11:08.834
What if it explodes
the moment you come near me?

11:08.918 --> 11:10.252
Hold on.

11:10.336 --> 11:12.630
I said I'm sorry! I'm apologizing!

11:12.713 --> 11:16.050
Watch it! I said don't come near me.

11:17.093 --> 11:20.513
I said, make it stop--

11:20.596 --> 11:21.597
Boom!

11:22.431 --> 11:25.643
Yes! That's what you get!

11:25.726 --> 11:27.895
Eat crocodile shit!

11:40.157 --> 11:41.075
It stopped.

11:41.158 --> 11:45.705
Come on. Don't panic and trip, Ermes.

11:45.788 --> 11:48.916
That sound was a warning.

11:49.834 --> 11:52.378
Right, Mr. Prison Guard?

11:53.504 --> 11:55.339
Dammit…

11:58.384 --> 12:01.470
So that was your ability, huh?

12:05.599 --> 12:07.017
Come on.

12:07.601 --> 12:11.230
There's only a tractor
and bags of flour in here.

12:11.313 --> 12:13.941
There's no point in looking inside.

12:14.525 --> 12:18.237
If this was an easy assignment,
then there was no need for volunteers.

12:20.448 --> 12:21.866
Seriously?

12:28.539 --> 12:31.041
There it is, Jolyne!

12:31.125 --> 12:32.293
It's the same tractor.

12:33.294 --> 12:36.505
That's the same tractor I saw on the disc.

12:37.006 --> 12:38.466
The number is the same too.

12:42.887 --> 12:44.930
STAND NAME: STONE OCEAN
STAND MASTER: JOLYNE CUJOH

12:45.806 --> 12:49.310
The same vehicle number. It says four.

12:49.894 --> 12:51.228
They're inside that tire.

12:51.312 --> 12:53.939
We can get to the discs
if we remove the tire.

12:54.023 --> 12:55.649
Listen up!

12:55.733 --> 12:57.902
We will now sweep the wetlands!

12:58.694 --> 13:02.531
The missing inmates
could have drowned in the waters.

13:02.615 --> 13:03.908
You will go look!

13:03.991 --> 13:07.661
Hey, there's no way
I'm going in the water.

13:07.745 --> 13:08.954
I'm not going.

13:09.455 --> 13:10.664
Let's go!

13:11.665 --> 13:13.709
Guess that vehicle is amphibious.

13:13.793 --> 13:15.336
Give me a break.

13:15.419 --> 13:18.506
Who knows what sort of disease
we'll catch in the wetlands!

13:18.589 --> 13:20.299
What a pain.

13:20.800 --> 13:22.259
Now's our chance.

13:22.343 --> 13:23.928
Let's remove the tire now!

13:24.011 --> 13:25.721
Hey, Jolyne.

13:25.805 --> 13:29.016
Doesn't something seem off?

13:29.099 --> 13:31.101
No, something is definitely wrong.

13:31.185 --> 13:33.896
Yes, if we don't remove the tire now,

13:33.979 --> 13:36.315
we would be separated from the guard.

13:36.398 --> 13:38.108
No, that's not what I mean.

13:38.192 --> 13:40.444
He said, "Five is plenty."

13:40.528 --> 13:41.779
That Warden.

13:42.363 --> 13:45.866
He said five inmates are enough.

13:46.700 --> 13:48.536
but there are six of us!

13:48.619 --> 13:51.455
Jolyne, what could this all mean?

13:51.539 --> 13:53.374
Including you and I…

13:55.417 --> 13:56.919
there's six of us here!

13:57.503 --> 14:00.256
I know there were only
the five of us when we left.

14:00.339 --> 14:03.843
But I wasn't paying attention
to how they looked.

14:03.926 --> 14:06.428
Jolyne, what do you think?

14:07.137 --> 14:08.264
I can't say.

14:08.889 --> 14:10.724
I was fixed on catching up.

14:10.808 --> 14:13.602
But then, everyone's wearing a bracelet.

14:14.103 --> 14:15.396
That's strange.

14:16.105 --> 14:18.482
Were there six of us

14:18.566 --> 14:20.484
right from the start?

14:20.568 --> 14:23.612
Hey, you think this is odd too?

14:24.822 --> 14:28.242
There should've been
only five of us, right?

14:28.325 --> 14:29.994
Can you tell who joined us and when?

14:30.077 --> 14:32.913
No, I could be mistaken.

14:32.997 --> 14:35.749
And it doesn't matter
how many of us there are.

14:35.833 --> 14:38.127
She's been with me the entire time.

14:39.003 --> 14:40.170
I remember her.

14:40.254 --> 14:42.006
She's Atroe.

14:42.089 --> 14:43.465
She gets picked on a lot.

14:44.049 --> 14:47.094
She volunteered to escape the bullying.

14:47.177 --> 14:48.053
Right?

14:48.554 --> 14:50.431
I don't know you.

14:50.514 --> 14:51.432
Hey!

14:53.267 --> 14:55.019
What's going on?

14:55.102 --> 14:57.271
Why is my bracelet beeping?

14:58.188 --> 14:59.607
Crap, mine is too!

14:59.690 --> 15:04.278
-Mine too.
-What the hell? They're all beeping.

15:04.361 --> 15:06.655
We must be nearing the 50-meter limit.

15:06.739 --> 15:08.949
But he can't be that far off.

15:10.492 --> 15:12.661
The guard is gone!

15:13.245 --> 15:14.330
Where did he go?

15:20.085 --> 15:21.879
The ATV is covered in blood.

15:22.379 --> 15:23.464
Why is that?

15:23.547 --> 15:25.716
The bracelet won't stop beeping

15:25.799 --> 15:29.511
because the guard's body
is getting farther away from us.

15:29.595 --> 15:32.306
Did he fall in the water
and being washed away?

15:33.015 --> 15:34.350
Find the guard!

15:34.433 --> 15:36.685
He must be within 50 meters!

15:36.769 --> 15:38.062
This is bad!

15:38.646 --> 15:40.064
Hey.

15:40.564 --> 15:43.192
My bracelet's beeping faster!

15:47.488 --> 15:48.572
No way.

15:52.326 --> 15:54.078
She's dead.

15:54.161 --> 15:55.037
No way.

15:55.579 --> 15:57.998
Did the additional person attack?

15:58.540 --> 16:02.586
Is it because we got close to the discs?

16:02.670 --> 16:06.715
Look 50 meters away opposite from
the girl that just exploded!

16:08.175 --> 16:09.301
There he is!

16:10.386 --> 16:11.720
Get near him!

16:11.804 --> 16:15.557
The bracelet will stop beeping
and it won't explode either.

16:15.641 --> 16:17.267
Keep your guard up, Jolyne.

16:17.351 --> 16:19.853
Our enemy is among them.

16:19.937 --> 16:21.522
Someone's a real psycho.

16:22.481 --> 16:24.692
She looks suspicious to me.

16:24.775 --> 16:26.944
The woman with the shaved head.

16:27.027 --> 16:30.155
And Atroe didn't recognize her.

16:30.739 --> 16:32.241
It must be her.

16:32.324 --> 16:34.660
Her Stand ability must have killed him.

16:34.743 --> 16:36.620
We'll kill her before she gets us!

16:36.704 --> 16:37.997
Calm down, Ermes.

16:38.580 --> 16:40.791
Say that the shaved woman is the culprit,

16:41.375 --> 16:47.089
so she was guarding the discs
in the shed since before we got here?

16:47.798 --> 16:49.299
That's what it would mean.

16:49.383 --> 16:50.551
That's impossible.

16:50.634 --> 16:52.469
She's an inmate.

16:52.553 --> 16:55.514
An inmate can't keep watch 24/7.

17:02.604 --> 17:03.772
Jolyne, stand back!

17:03.856 --> 17:05.649
-Something's there!
-What?

17:05.733 --> 17:07.234
Just step back.

17:07.317 --> 17:08.777
Get away from the water!

17:13.949 --> 17:14.992
Ermes.

17:15.075 --> 17:17.369
-Did you see something?
-No.

17:20.748 --> 17:22.332
It was nothing.

17:22.416 --> 17:25.711
But I'm not getting in the marsh anymore.

17:26.295 --> 17:27.588
And Jolyne.

17:27.671 --> 17:30.257
We can't be separated, no matter what.

17:30.340 --> 17:32.551
We don't know who the enemy is.

17:32.634 --> 17:36.555
Right. And these bracelets
complicate things.

17:36.638 --> 17:38.766
To take the discs from the shed,

17:38.849 --> 17:43.604
we must be within 50 meters of the guard
and the other three inmates.

17:49.485 --> 17:50.319
Ermes!

17:55.407 --> 17:57.242
Something's in the bucket!

17:57.326 --> 17:59.161
My face got sucked in!

18:02.414 --> 18:05.584
What is this plankton-looking thing?

18:07.628 --> 18:08.837
What?

18:08.921 --> 18:10.089
It split into two.

18:11.215 --> 18:13.509
No, four!

18:13.592 --> 18:14.635
These creatures…

18:17.513 --> 18:20.849
The bucket wasn't empty.

18:20.933 --> 18:22.768
I didn't look hard enough.

18:22.851 --> 18:25.562
They were already in the water.

18:32.986 --> 18:34.363
Smack!

18:37.908 --> 18:38.951
Ermes!

18:40.160 --> 18:41.537
Jolyne, don't come in!

18:42.204 --> 18:44.998
The water is not safe!
They're multiplying!

18:46.250 --> 18:47.626
They can rapidly multiply.

18:48.544 --> 18:49.962
Get out of the water.

18:50.045 --> 18:53.006
You won't make it in time.
I fell into the Stand's trap.

18:55.134 --> 18:56.343
Stone Ocean!

19:04.852 --> 19:06.478
I'll get him now.

19:07.855 --> 19:08.689
Jolyne.

19:10.274 --> 19:11.733
You're walking on the thread?

19:13.235 --> 19:18.240
Doesn't that mean
you're unraveling your own body?

19:18.824 --> 19:20.826
Jolyne, stay away!

19:20.909 --> 19:23.245
I'll take care of myself!

19:34.298 --> 19:35.382
This is crazy!

19:38.719 --> 19:39.845
It's true.

19:39.928 --> 19:42.055
Yes, it's pretty crazy.

19:42.639 --> 19:44.558
Good grief.

19:44.641 --> 19:48.395
I would've been toast
if I hadn't unraveled so much thread.

19:49.188 --> 19:50.731
So this is your power.

19:50.814 --> 19:53.192
Her body has a hole in it.

19:53.275 --> 19:55.861
She let him punch her
so she could grab onto him.

20:04.995 --> 20:07.497
Jolyne, get out of the water now.

20:07.581 --> 20:09.416
Don't stand up, Ermes!

20:09.499 --> 20:10.375
That thing.

20:10.876 --> 20:13.879
It's a bunch of small Stands
clustered together!

20:13.962 --> 20:16.548
It hid inside the tiny bit
of water in the bucket,

20:16.632 --> 20:18.383
and it dragged me in!

20:18.467 --> 20:19.593
I know that.

20:19.676 --> 20:21.970
So don't stand up.

20:22.679 --> 20:24.431
Grab it underwater.

20:24.514 --> 20:27.017
The thread that I'm releasing!

20:38.195 --> 20:39.238
It's fast.

20:39.780 --> 20:42.074
It's powerful too, but its speed...

20:44.451 --> 20:45.744
Just what is it?

20:46.286 --> 20:48.330
A Stand's speed and power should weaken…

20:48.413 --> 20:50.499
the farther it separates from its user.

20:51.875 --> 20:53.126
It got me!

20:53.210 --> 20:54.544
Stay calm, Jolyne.

20:55.128 --> 20:56.755
I put my sticker on it.

20:57.756 --> 21:00.008
When I was caught in its arms earlier.

21:00.634 --> 21:02.302
This is my Stand ability.

21:02.886 --> 21:04.054
I'll peel it off now!

21:15.774 --> 21:18.277
Run further inland!

21:31.707 --> 21:33.375
It's not coming onto land.

21:33.458 --> 21:36.378
Seems it only attacks in the water.

21:36.878 --> 21:37.796
Please respond!

21:38.380 --> 21:41.591
This is inmate FE32125.

21:41.675 --> 21:42.926
This is an emergency.

21:43.510 --> 21:45.053
The guard got in an accident.

21:45.137 --> 21:47.931
Send help immediately!

21:48.432 --> 21:50.726
What happened to you two?

21:50.809 --> 21:53.395
It looked like you were running on water…

21:53.478 --> 21:56.148
You three, don't take another step!

21:56.231 --> 21:58.608
Step away from the water!

22:01.153 --> 22:03.613
Don't try to pull anything on us.

22:03.697 --> 22:06.116
I know one of you did this!

22:09.786 --> 22:12.122
In order to obtain the discs,

22:12.748 --> 22:15.542
it seems we have to defeat the User first.

23:41.086 --> 23:46.091
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
